    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207270/extras/522652eb5f4d5b0f33b6546eb30351da.poster.avif?t=1731085322\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207270/extras/522652eb5f4d5b0f33b6546eb30351da.webp?t=1731085322\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=337 /></picture></span> <strong>KiLL</strong>...................................................................................................... FOR THE SAKE OF TiME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE KILLED</strong>............................................................................................. FOR THE SAKE OF TiME </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNTIL <strong>TiME</strong>............................................................................................. RUNS OUT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IN <strong>ENDLESS </strong>............................................................................................. CORRiDORS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207270/extras/6232009defb51462f2a49ac30321e850.poster.avif?t=1731085322\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207270/extras/6232009defb51462f2a49ac30321e850.webm?t=1731085322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207270/extras/6232009defb51462f2a49ac30321e850.mp4?t=1731085322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>TiME WASTER is a fast corridor first-person shooter with a special style. You will find yourself in a place where you must kill for the sake of time and will be killed for the sake of time............................................................................................. Do <strong>YOU</strong> \u200b\u200bvalue your time?</p>",
